# Public voice and privacy

This repo is a public portfolio demo. Chat may use private background to make P0s real. **Every file that ships** (README, UI copy, commits, comments, sample data, diagrams) stays generic, calm, and professional.

## Always

- Hiring-manager tone. Short. Clean. No slang, gossip, or workplace war stories
- Never label copy as an **interview one-liner**, elevator pitch, or similar. Say the point in a normal sentence, or skip it
- Call it a **gated article** / **news app** / **magic link**. Never a real brand or employer
- Sample PRs, emails, and articles are clearly fake
- Footer and README follow Ramona's public-repo standard (**Notes / Privacy**)

## Never in this repo

- Employer, customer, or product names
- Live auth URLs, login challenges, device IDs, API keys, or tokens
- Private personal details
- Copy that could be read as leaking an internal flow or naming a workplace

## Translate before you write

If a real-world case informed a golden, rewrite it as a generic news-app path before it touches `README.md`, fixtures, or UI.
